overy, and planner[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]pomodoro-move-engine[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pomodoro-move-engine: add the named-Pomodoro grammar, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]entry/bullet-context model, sibling target discovery with count and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]clamping, and the pure same-file move planner to bob-navigation-hotkeys,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]all exported and unit tested with no UI or routing change.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Picker, routing, and commit[/bold #D7AFFF]                                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]pomodoro-move-ui[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pomodoro-move-engine[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pomodoro-move-ui: add the destination picker rows and modal with typed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]create-new-Pomodoro support, route `Ctrl+Shift+M` to the Pomodoro move [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]when the cursor is on a sub-bullet, and commit the planned move as one [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]guarded editor transaction with a reporting notice.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Docs, version, sync, and glossary[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]pomodoro-move-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pomodoro-move-ui[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pomodoro-move-docs: bump the plugin manifest, extend the bob-plugins [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]README, deploy with `bob plugins sync`, rewrite the Pomodoro glossary [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]strand to cover named Pomodoros and the keymap, and regenerate sase [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]memory.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-16","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-16.1","reaso